*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~16.67 seconds<sup>180f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~23.33 seconds<sup>300f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
