**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threat of this stage is Super Metal Hippoe since it can form a deadly team with Lione Hippoe and shred through your cats faster. Sunny Celeboodle is also difficult, as it can comfortably sit behind Super Metal Hippoe and constantly harass your front line.

It is recommended to bring [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]]. Stacking [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cats]] at the start will help, as a single Bahamut Cat's attack can not one-shot the Lione Hippoes on this difficulty. Do not bring [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], as Sunny Celeboodle outranges her and will instantly dispatch her. If [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] is in your lineup, note that although she is a good attacker, she cannot knock back the Super Metal Hippoe.

